      "claim": "All L1 gold-context records report oral or systemic bioavailability at or above 20% for their reference molecules, including paliperidone 28%, haloperidol 35%, ACT-1004-1239 53%, BI425809 71.64%, meptazinol 27.9% in cirrhosis, pethidine 0.80, pentazocine 0.68, and ciramadol 80%.",
